  "description": "An Seohae turns into a 'dog' whenever she drinks. She thought she finally caused trouble with her old-fashioned superior, but her one-night stand turns out to be Seogwanghyeon, her brother's friend whom she's known since childhood?! And this promiscuous playboy is even the CEO of her company. 'I don't remember it well. So, let's do it again sober,' he says. It seems CEO Seogwanghyeon actually has more weaknesses. 'I'll take the upper hand in this situation!'\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000082249), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14855275)",
